## Variable Resolution

| Variable | Source |
|----------|--------|
| `AGENT_DISPLAY_NAME` | Contract → agent_name |
| `AGENT_DESCRIPTION` | Contract → Role (first sentence) |
| `RESOLVED_MODEL` | Contract model_tier → Customer's model mapping |
| `ARGUMENT_HINT` | Contract → argument-hint or generated from inputs |
| `CONTRACT_ID` | Contract → contract_id |
| `PIPELINE_POSITION` | Contract → pipeline_position |
| `MODEL_TIER` | Contract → model_tier |
| `TOOLS` | Contract tool_categories → resolved to platform tools |
| `ROLE_FROM_CONTRACT` | Contract → Role section (verbatim) |
| `PRIME_DIRECTIVE_FROM_CONTRACT` | Contract → Prime Directive (verbatim) |
| `CUSTOMER_GUARDRAILS` | Onboarding answers → Agent Behavioral Guardrails |
| `AGENT_SLUG` | Agent name in kebab-case (e.g., `agent0_ticket_analyzer`) |
| `INPUTS` | Contract → Inputs table |
| `INPUT_VALIDATION_RULES` | Generated from contract inputs (file existence, format checks) |
| `OUTPUTS` | Contract → Outputs table |
| `OUTPUT_HANDLING_RULES` | Generated from contract outputs (write location, validation) |
| `WORKFLOW_INSTRUCTIONS` | Contract → Workflow Logic, adapted to customer tools |
| `USE_MCP` | True if platform uses MCP integration |
| `MCP_TOOL_REFERENCES` | MCP server/tool invocation instructions from `.mcp.json` |
| `USE_CONNECTOR_SKILLS` | True if platform uses API-based Connector Skills |
| `SKILL_REFERENCES` | Generated skills matching contract skill references |
| `CHECKPOINTING_STRATEGY` | Generated: what state to save, when, format |
| `RESUME_PROTOCOL` | Generated: how to load checkpoint and resume |
| `RERUN_PROTOCOL` | Generated: how to handle re-run with customer feedback |
| `ACCESS_RESTRICTIONS_FROM_CONTRACT` | Contract → Access Restrictions |
| `HOOK_REFERENCES` | Generated hooks matching contract hook points |
| `QUALITY_CHECKLIST_FROM_CONTRACT` | Contract → Quality Checklist |
| `COMPLETION_CRITERIA` | Generated: explicit conditions for agent to be considered done |
| `AGENT_VERSION` | Contract → version |
